# credentials and captured traffic from the probe side.
# The probe lives outside this repo, but a future session may copy its state in;
# these names must never be committable. See HANDOFF.md 「凭据存放」.
douyu-tokens.json
cookie-header.txt
cookies.json
*.mitm
*.mitmproxy
probe-state/

# Agent-facing documents. These are written for models working in this checkout,
# not for people browsing the repo, and a model reads them straight off disk —
# so tracking them buys nothing. That includes docs/adr/: an architecture decision
# record is written for whoever (or whatever) works here next, and README.md is
# the single human-facing document. Move an ADR into README.md if it ever deserves
# a wider audience.
AGENTS.md
GLOSSARY.md
HANDOFF.md
docs/

